### Criar filme
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/filmes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "Toy Story",
  "ano": 1995,
  "duracaoMin": 81
}

### Listar
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/filmes

### Obter por id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/filmes/1

### Atualizar
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/filmes/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "Toy Story (1995)",
  "ano": 1995,
  "duracaoMin": 81
}

### Remover
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/filmes/1
